3. IN-APP PURCHASES, SLOTS, AND USAGE LIMITS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The Software operates under a freemium model with permanent capacity expansion:
(a) The base version of the Software grants the User up to two (2) complimentary workout routine slots ("Free Slots").
(b) To create and maintain additional workout routines beyond the complimentary limit simultaneously, the User must purchase permanent additional slots (priced at R$ 2,00 per additional slot, subject to change). 
(c) Once an additional slot is purchased, it belongs to the User permanently for use within the Software. If the User deletes a routine occupying a purchased slot, the slot remains available for creating a new routine at no additional charge.
(d) All purchases are processed securely through official platform billing systems (such as Google Play Billing) and are non-refundable, except as required by applicable law or Google Play Store policies.

